<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella is confronting a wave of armed violence after a police academy attack killed 21 people and nationwide protests erupted over tax plans and spending cuts. He ordered a tenth bombing against a narcoterrorist target in Valle del Cauca and urged the United States to prosecute former President Petro. U.S. Secretary of War Pete Hegseth arrived in Bogotá, delivered a C-130, met De la Espriella and announced a US-Venezuela military partnership, while Colombia rejected a U.S. proposal for joint anti-drug strikes. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPLUdEX2NMaFBqSWQ4RlNLd2hUcEJrQmEyODV4TXlnTk1IR3hUeUxfRnZ5UDJOVFNZX1llSjRiT1RYTXNhc2tycjhMUUh2ejBscXIzMXVlOU44a21oWVlDb1AyU2RLNG12d0pGLUZpaW5PTlVEWkJEckxGVDYtOUtLWG4yeUk1VHgwTkVYNGdYenVrZXBhZjF4UURyaWExU2JYaDk5dU5XaGpHTEh1XzNWOVI5YnEtUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPX3pBcEVuWWJFX0FsRUI1eElBWUFETDBTT09PdTJkTldsRjRzU3ZFcXE0UTd5RXRJdmVLRVc4MEh2S3ZpSUpJbXlETjZyZ3V3X3RZMHhoN1ZaQS0yNTY1dk1qTDNLbjhtOEdnNWtuYjMteFIxOGNEZlRSOE02TnV4RWUxejdTVmxXU0ZKQTY0VEpDSDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &